  for the veteran and military community. Join us at this performance to sup
 port the latest class of Comedy Bootcamp grads.\n\nAll sales are final. Ref
 unds and exchanges are offered only when a show is canceled or rescheduled.
 \n\nAdmission Policies\n\nPatrons must be 18 or older to attend events or c
 lasses at the DC Improv. Any exceptions are clearly noted in the event desc
